  "helicoplacus": {
    "reference": "Sprinkle & Wilbur 2005 pp. 281\u2013285 and Fig. 1D inspected from the retained PDF misleadingly named 2006. Fig. 1D is a latex/silicone cast of H. everndeni LACMNH17529, not Waucobella in panel B. Primary 2006 publisher abstract/introduction/systematic excerpts independently retrieved; synonymy under H. gilberti is supported, but full 2006 text is not claimed read. Three ambulacral paths meet at a lateral mouth; shell rows are left-handed. Anal position remains unresolved and no invented anal pyramid was added.",
    "url": "https://research.nhm.org/pdfs/33561/33561.pdf",
    "additional_urls": [
      "https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S1871174X06000412"
