  "stromatocystites": {
    "reference": "Smith 1985 pp. 736\u2013740 and plate 87 inspected visually: BM(NH)E16004 panels 1/2/5 and E63138 panel 6 are latex casts. Text supports a fully plated low subpentagonal body, narrow surface ambulacra, proximal 2\u20131\u20132 arrangement and noncentral periproct. Zamora et al. 2015 publisher abstract/introduction/systematic excerpts support S. flexibilis synonymy and aboral attachment; no full-text access claim.",
    "url": "https://palass.org/sites/default/files/media/publications/palaeontology/volume_28/vol28_part4_pp715-756.pdf",
    "additional_urls": [
      "https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S0016699515000637"
    ],
    "concept": "Genuine concept is too thick and its ambulacra too broad. Final visibly corrects both with a continuous low disc, five narrow surface bands and broad plated interambulacra.",
